## 🧠 DASHBOARD PHILOSOPHY

Your dashboard answers **only 3 questions**:

1. **How much money is stuck?**
2. **What needs action today?**
3. **Who is causing the delay?**

If a widget doesn’t answer one of these → delete it.

---

# 🧱 DASHBOARD LAYOUT (DESKTOP)

```
┌────────── KPI STRIP (Top) ──────────┐
│ Outstanding | Overdue | Due Soon    │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘

┌──── Action Table ────┬─ Insights ───┐
│ Needs Follow-up      │ Top Delayers │
│ (main focus)         │              │
└──────────────────────┴──────────────┘
```

Clean. Calm. Purpose-driven.

---

# 1️⃣ TOP KPI STRIP (MOST IMPORTANT)

### Visual

* Horizontal cards
* Big numbers
* Minimal labels
* Soft background

### Cards to include (ONLY THESE):

#### 💰 Total Outstanding

> “How much money hasn’t arrived yet?”

#### ⏰ Overdue Amount

> “How much is already late?”

#### 📅 Due This Week

> “What’s coming up?”

#### 📊 Avg Delay (days)

> “Is this getting better or worse?”

❌ No charts
❌ No percentages
❌ No month selector in MVP

Numbers hit harder.

---

# 2️⃣ “NEEDS FOLLOW-UP TODAY” (CORE SECTION)

This is your **hero table**.

### Table columns:

* Client Name
* Invoice #
* Amount
* Due Date
* Days Overdue
* **Action**

### Action button:

* “Follow up now”
* Opens invoice detail → reminder options

### UX details:

* Rows highlighted:

  * Red → overdue
  * Yellow → due today
* Sticky header
* Max 8–10 rows (avoid overwhelm)

👉 Emotion:

> “I know exactly what to do next.”

---

# 3️⃣ INSIGHTS (RIGHT SIDE – OPTIONAL BUT POWERFUL)

Keep this **small & sharp**.

### Include only:

* 🔴 Top 3 delayed clients
* 💸 Oldest unpaid invoice
* ⏳ Amount stuck > 30 days

No graphs.
Just lists.

---

# 4️⃣ EMPTY STATE (VERY IMPORTANT)

When user has **no invoices yet**:

### Show:

* Friendly illustration
* Text:

  > “No invoices yet.
  > Add your first invoice to start tracking payments.”

### Button:

👉 **Add Invoice**

This reduces anxiety.

---

# 🎨 VISUAL STYLE

* White background
* Subtle card borders
* Soft shadows (very light)
* Red used **only** for overdue
* Green only for “Paid” (rare on dashboard)

---

# 🧠 WHAT NOT TO SHOW ON DASHBOARD ❌

* Paid invoices list
* Reports
* Monthly graphs
* Client directory
* Reminder rules

Dashboard is **action**, not analysis.

---

# 📱 MOBILE DASHBOARD (SHORT NOTE)

* KPI cards → horizontal scroll
* Table → stacked cards
* Follow-up button → full width

Same info. Different layout.

---

# 🔥 WHY THIS DASHBOARD WORKS

* Founder opens → sees pain
* System tells them what to do
* No thinking, only action
* Builds daily habit

This is how **money-focused SaaS** win.

